# Clang sanitizer ignorelist for -fsanitize=implicit-conversion builds: pass -fsanitize-ignorelist=<this file>.
# Standard library templates convert between char and unsigned char, and between sizes and differences, on
# purpose; matching their mangled names leaves only conversions in this repository's code to report.
fun:_ZNSt*
fun:_ZNKSt*
fun:_ZSt*
fun:_ZN9__gnu_cxx*
fun:_ZNK9__gnu_cxx*
